hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere khaleel Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen cheezon ki waseeyat farmai: Sone se pahle witr, chasht ki do rak'aten, aur har mahine teen din ke roze."
"232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Mujhe mere khaleel ne teen cheezon ki waseeyat farmai: Sone se pahle witr, chasht ki do rak'aten, aur har mahine teen din ke roze.'"
"233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo witr na padhe woh ham mein se nahin."
"234","[AI-translation] Main ne Abu Usamah se kaha: Kya tumhen Abu Hayyan ne Abu Zur'ah se, Abu Hurairah se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal se subah ki namaz ke waqt farmaya: 'Aey Bilal! Mujhe apne us amal ke bare mein batao jis ki tum ne Islam mein manfa'at ki aur jo tumhare nazdeek sab se ziyada ummeed wala hai, kyunke main ne kal raat jannat mein apne aage tumhare jooton ki aahat suni.' Unhon ne kaha: Koi amal jo main ne kiya hai mere nazdeek is se ziyada ummeed wala nahin siwae is ke ke main ne raat ya din ki kisi ghadi mein poori taharat nahin ki magar main ne apne Rabb ke liye jitni namaz muqaddar ki gai padhi. To Abu Usamah ne is ka iqrar kiya aur kaha: 'Han.'"
"235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi raat nahin magar Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala us mein raat ke aakhri tihai mein nazil hota hai, phir us ka munadi pukarta hai: Koi mangne wala hai ke main use dun? Koi bakhshish mangne wala hai ke main use bakhshun' — teen martaba."
"236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah har raat jab raat ka aakhri tihai baqi rah jae duniya ke aasman ki taraf nazil hota hai aur farmata hai: Kaun mujhe pukarta hai ke main us ki dua qabool karun, aur kaun mujh se bakhshish mangta hai ke main use bakhshun.'"
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek raat qiyam karke namaz padhte rahe. Phir jab subah hui to farmaya: 'Allah falan par rahm farmaye; us ki kitni qira'at ne mujhe yaad dilaya, jabke main use bhool gaya tha.'"
"238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un donon mein utni dair qiyam farmate jitni Fatihatul Kitab padhe — yani subah se pahle ki do rak'aten."
"239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) witr ke baad kuch nahin karte the siwae is ke ke miswak farmate phir do halki rak'aten padhte."
"240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab raat mein tahajjud padhte to farmate: Aey Allah! Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen ka noor hai. Aur Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen ka qayyam hai. Aur Tere liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hai un ka Rabb hai. Tu Haq hai, Tera wa'da haq hai, Teri mulaqat haq hai, Tera qaul haq hai, jahannam haq hai, jannat haq hai, aur Qayamat haq hai. Aey Allah! Main Tujh par iman laya, aur Tere liye islam laya aur Tujh par tawakkul kiya, aur Teri taraf ruju kiya, aur Tere sath jhagda kiya, aur Teri taraf faisla le gaya. Tu Woh hai jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin."
"241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab raat mein tahajjud padhte to dua farmate, farmate: Aey Allah! Tere liye hamd hai — phir rawi ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main apni khala Maimunah ke paas soya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein uthe, to miswak ki, phir mashkize ke paas aae aur wuzu farmaya. Phir main utha aur wuzu kiya. Rawi ne kaha: Aur main nahin janta unhon ne miswak ka zikr kiya. Phir main Aap ke baen khada hua, to Aap ne mujhe pakda aur ghuma diya yahan tak ke mujhe apne dayen kar diya aur mera sar sahalane lage. Phir Aap ne chaar padhin, phir witr padhi, phir fajr ki do rak'aten padhin, phir subah ki namaz ke liye nikle."
